### Get all contacts locally
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts
### Get one contact locally
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/6aa16a69c6af1d07d2d09c18

### Create Contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Frank",
    "lastName": "White",
    "birthday": "06/08/1985",
    "email": "georgeR@gmail.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Orange"
}

